{"4376460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tache Noire", "steam_appid": 4376460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tache Noire is an exploration based survival horror game where you can explore every single building in any order you like. Explore, fight and solve puzzles. Experience the story of five friends getting together for a reunion in Lucenille.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-Linear Exploration</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go anywhere and complete the game in any order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every single building and house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Hours of exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/f988f6a155cea59bc21d674472635004.poster.avif?t=1776332952\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/f988f6a155cea59bc21d674472635004.webm?t=1776332952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/f988f6a155cea59bc21d674472635004.mp4?t=1776332952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adaptive Enemies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot specific parts of the enemy to change their behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close doors on them to slow them down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lure them into traps and Conserve your Ammo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight different kinds of enemies and find their weakness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/2eb54dba3042a9d0bd3a24053b118a1d.poster.avif?t=1776332952\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/2eb54dba3042a9d0bd3a24053b118a1d.webm?t=1776332952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/2eb54dba3042a9d0bd3a24053b118a1d.mp4?t=1776332952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons and Weapon Customizations</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the way your weapon works with attachments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons at the coffee shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually reload your revolvers and your shotgun. Grab those bullets and slam them into the cylinder.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rumour and Notes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck on a puzzle? Open the rumour tab and get a short summary of the events up to this point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgot something? Important codes are automatically written in the notes tab.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Loot and responsive enviroment</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get loot based on the equipment you have.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab phyiscs objects and stack them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl through vents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove barricades.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Choices and Endings</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have Conversations with the inhabitants of the town. Decide wheter or not you want to help them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve all the different endings for Tache Noire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/95fa1d9d7c3d74ba752245b3b1f51b4e.webp?t=1776332952\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/95fa1d9d7c3d74ba752245b3b1f51b4e.poster.avif?t=1776332952\" class=\"bb_img\" width=727 height=236 /></picture></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tache Noire is an exploration based survival horror game where you can explore every single building in any order you like. Explore, fight and solve puzzles. Experience the story of five friends getting together for a reunion in Lucenille.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-Linear Exploration</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go anywhere and complete the game in any order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every single building and house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Hours of exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/f988f6a155cea59bc21d674472635004.poster.avif?t=1776332952\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/f988f6a155cea59bc21d674472635004.webm?t=1776332952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/f988f6a155cea59bc21d674472635004.mp4?t=1776332952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adaptive Enemies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot specific parts of the enemy to change their behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close doors on them to slow them down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lure them into traps and Conserve your Ammo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight different kinds of enemies and find their weakness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/2eb54dba3042a9d0bd3a24053b118a1d.poster.avif?t=1776332952\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/2eb54dba3042a9d0bd3a24053b118a1d.webm?t=1776332952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376460/extras/2eb54dba3042a9d0bd3a24053b118a1d.mp4?t=1776332952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons and Weapon Customizations</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the way your weapon works with attachments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons at the coffee shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually reload your revolvers and your shotgun. Grab those bullets and slam them into the cylinder.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rumour and Notes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck on a puzzle? Open the rumour tab and get a short summary of the events up to this point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgot something? Important codes are automatically written in the notes tab.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></